&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sir Ruttlesurg of England,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;His teeth were sharp and his skin was quite bland,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;he was so pale you&#039;d think him undead,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;If you do not sing him in song,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;he&#039;d drink your brain through you head,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;And did we catch him, that depends&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;He fought many a battle, each time he died,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;He would mostly fight for the wrong side,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;each time looking more grim,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;For fighting he wants honor,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;To sing this you shall abide,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;This pride honestly goes to his head,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;To be a victim you shall envy the dead,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;To play this song on a bard&#039;s &amp;quot;guitar&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Believe me-you should go far,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;a piece of turkey to be frozen in ice,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Not to be dipped once, twice but thrice,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;This special thing,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;To be prepared by two d-class,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;one being a girl and one being a lass,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;This ritual giving another bypass,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;To a thing that will eventually come to pass,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;The danger of this monstrosity!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
