class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><em>Sir Ruttlesurg of England,</em><br /> <em>His teeth were sharp and his skin was quite bland,</em><br /> <em>he was so pale you'd think him undead,</em><br /> <em>If you do not sing him in song,</em><br /> <em>he'd drink your brain through you head,</em><br /> <em>And did we catch him, that depends</em><br /> <em>He fought many a battle, each time he died,</em><br /> <em>He would mostly fight for the wrong side,</em><br /> <em>each time looking more grim,</em><br /> <em>For fighting he wants honor,</em><br /> <em>To sing this you shall abide,</em><br /> <em>This pride honestly goes to his head,</em><br /> <em>To be a victim you shall envy the dead,</em><br /> <em>To play this song on a bard's &quot;guitar&quot;</em><br /> <em>Believe me-you should go far,</em><br /> <em>a piece of turkey to be frozen in ice,</em><br /> <em>Not to be dipped once, twice but thrice,</em><br /> <em>This special thing,</em><br /> <em>To be prepared by two d-class,</em><br /> <em>one being a girl and one being a lass,</em><br /> <em>This ritual giving another bypass,</em><br /> <em>To a thing that will eventually come to pass,</em><br /> <em>The danger of this monstrosity!</em></p> <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Soldier_of_29th_regiment_1742.jpg/220px-Soldier_of_29th_regiment_1742.jpg" alt="220px-Soldier_of_29th_regiment_1742.jpg" class="image" /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cole-13" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6984611&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607830217" alt="Cole 13" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6984611)