 </blockquote> <p><em>Update report-Dr. Derrick<br /> After recruitment, Todd’s caloric intake increased 475% from the group’s average, this continued day by day he grew larger and taller, till two weeks later we confirmed that his state is becoming stable he weighed 158 kilograms, 2.28 meters high, and just for a description, he seems as a Caucasian orc, with those tusks and chin of his, his IQ increased 30 points, we’ll keep watch on him and what he does, but he still seems submissive and valuable as a researcher, worker, and architect. Yes, an architect made plans for a facility that would facilitate 50 entities ready for transfer, experimentation, offices, etc., the plans have been granted by Dr. Mercer<br /> End update</em></p> <hr /> <p><em>Update report-Dr. Derrick<br /> Ross contacted Dr. Mercer, Ross asked permission to form a special branch of the MTF turning them into A-B’s as the effect does not make them dependent upon the compound, and make their senses more refined and among other things, and that Ross would lead this Branch as captain. DR. (redacted) accepted such proposal, forming Kilo Tango-22 (Dire_Wolves)<br /> End update</em></p> <hr /> <p><strong>5267-breach-4 Audio log</strong></p> <p><em>Audio log entry- dr. brooks, date(𶐉𶐉𶐉𶐉𶐿𶐉)<br /> There had been a breach, a boar dependent to the compound had grown into 6 meters in length, which climbed across the walls with its mutated limbs and went inside the tunnel Todd and his colleagues made all those years ago, and was running upwards to the cave’s entrance, personnel above are trying to hold a barrier to stop the boar, in such short notice that the staff knew that they were not enough, but they held their ground knowing the price incompetence would have to pay.<br /> I, Dr. Brooks, agent Ross, agent Oliver, Dr. Dravis, and Dr. Todd went to a high-pressure elevator that goes to the speed of a hundred meters per second, once at the desired level we went towards the buggies dr. Todd developed in case of a breach, we ran towards a buggy agent Oliver drove whilst I and agent Ross handled two machine guns on the buggy, as we went pursuit we shot the boar’s legs again and again but the boar never flinched on such firearms, moments later Drs. Dravis and Todd followed pursuit Dravis radioed that the hide of the boar was too thick to shoot, he told us to get some grenades at the storage box on our seats, we took some grenades and threw them at the boar Oliver got one lucky shot as the grenade exploded at the boar’s chest, and we saw the boar’s exposed ribcage, the boar stopped, turned around and ran towards us it was about forty feet from us, just before Todd and Dravis used automatic grenade launchers to shoot the 6 meter boar till the boar was nothing more than charred meat lying on the ground, but knowing that the boar might still regenerate Todd attached a flame thrower to his buggy and started to set the boar on fire again until the bones were black in color, and would crumble when Dravis stepped on its skull, when that was done Todd told Ross and Oliver to smash the remaining pieces of charred bone, they did as they were told, after that I reported to the men above via radio that the threat was now neutralized and ordered a group alongside Oliver to follow the cleanup procedure Dravis formed a few weeks ago and to rebuild the metal gate which the boar smashed through<br /> A few days’ time Dravis and Todd will be promoted to level three clearances<br /> End audio log</em></p> <p><strong>test-logs-B315-L</strong></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Test log-SCP-5267-date-(redacted)</strong><br /> <strong>(00:00:01)</strong>SCP-5267-A-1 is unconscious beside the south wall due to tranquilizers inflicted minutes ago,</p> <p><strong>(00:00:57)</strong> A D-class went inside the cell with a fire axe, as orders were stated that he would need to cut off the subject’s head, the door slid shut again</p> <p><strong>(00:00:63)</strong> the D-class proceeds to go near striking range approximately 5 seconds the D-class went near the subject’s head, there the D-class trembled in fear, but proceeds to hack off the subject’s head, the first strike, the specimen’s head was cut over 50% through,</p> <p><strong>(00:01:40)</strong> the specimen’s body tensed and jerked rapidly,</p> <p><strong>(00:02:01)</strong> the D-class proceeded to cut the remaining tissue, after this, the D-class threw the axe at the specimen’s left shoulder and ran towards the door,</p> <p><strong>(00:02:05)</strong> the specimen immediately stood and proceeded to claw the D-class to shreds,</p> <p><strong>(00:03:15)</strong> when the specimen was content, he turned around, in which footage saw what seemed were two red-veined eyes bulging from the base of the neck where the D-class proceeded to cut through, the specimen continued to walk around</p> <p><strong>(00:05:54)</strong> after mauling the D-class a skull was pushed from the base of the neck essentially the chest with a soft slushing sound, the mandible began to be pushed afterward, and with the head complete with bones and jaw muscles, the specimen proceeded to eat the D class while retaining its past appearance until not even blood remained as the specimen licked the floor, with this the specimen went towards its original decapitated head and ate it.</p> <p><strong>Additional notes</strong><br /> // Well, as expected, but we now want to know how much past knowledge was retained, even without consuming the head, D-class experiments are authorized//<br /> <strong>End test log</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><strong>Test log-compound B315-L-3, date(redacted)</strong></p> <p><strong>Foreword;</strong></p> <p>six D class are to be included in this operation, who are D-class 34255, 34258, 34534, 32456,36542, and 40034 all of them is to be induced by compound B315-L, three of which are to become dependent in compound B315-L, the other set will be independent, once altered, they are to be conducted a test which will determine their mental retainment which is; to make them memorize a series of numbers which are <strong>(537638256443282463686)</strong> then subject them to tranquilizers and behead them, MTF armed with 70-caliber rifles as a minimum is put on standby in the whole process when beheaded, they will be tranquilized again for safety measures, at this state they will be contained in a standard 3-by-3&#160;b-3 cell until they retain their heads, once retained they will be requested to recite the code, through this we get results</p> <p>results were:</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td>description</td> <td>recitement</td> <td>notes</td> </tr> <tr> <td>D class XXXX-state-independent</td> <td>537638256443282463686</td> <td>3 minutes before recollecting</td> </tr> <tr> <td>D class XXXX-state-independent</td> <td>537638256443282463686</td> <td>2 minutes before recollecting</td> </tr> <tr> <td>D class XXXX-state-independent</td> <td>537638256443282463686</td> <td>1 minutes before recollecting</td> </tr> <tr> <td>D class XXXX-state-dependent</td> <td>537638256443282463686</td> <td>30 seconds before recollecting</td> </tr> <tr> <td>D class XXXX-state-dependent</td> <td>537638256443282463686</td> <td>3 minutes before recollecting</td> </tr> <tr> <td>D class XXXX-state-dependent</td> <td>537638256443282463686</td> <td>2 minutes before recollecting</td> </tr> </table> <p><strong>Results show that no matter the state, their minds are capable of retaining “lost” memory, this gives credence to the theory that all induced cells have a common database for all information present in brain activity</strong><br /> Note: during the times when we made them dependent and independent their height, weight, and appendages seem to have an average no matter their state as their average increase is still an average increase., When consuming the decapitated head, neither adverse nor favorable effects were shown<br /> End test log</p> <p><strong>incident-report-5267-6</strong></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Incident report-Dr. Chase-Date(redacted)</strong><br /> The team and I were talking about changing the cavity’s status to an EX, Dravis and his associates changed their minds when Derrick and Brooks told them that the foundation was not all-knowing neither all benevolent</p> <p>indeed we had enemies, GOC, Chaos Insurgency, Serpent's Hand, and more,</p> <p>we ended up agreeing that compound B315-L should not be made known ever by any means,</p> <p>I, Edward, and two kilo-tango-22 operatives namely Oliver and Daniel went out to catalog native animals in the northwest side of Prime when the incident occurred,<br /> the wall on our right burst open, dust rocks and debris were flying around the place, Oliver immediately called backup, and Daniel shot out an electric net,<br /> but before he could set his gun, three arrows flanged through his chest, with a loud grunt he knelt, out came from the dust of clouds a cry of anger echoed around us followed by three armed hairy figures riding on horseback, but instead of horses they rode on biped reptilian creatures similar to fossil-creatures specifically Mesozoic, we watched in horror as Oliver turned his gun to 6000-Voltz and shot out short bursts at the attackers a hundred feet away,<br /> Edward quickly took an electric handgun at his side, the foundation developed a few months ago, and began shooting the three figures, Oliver successfully shot down a rider and its dino, Edward shot another dino down, the rider jumped off and ran towards us, I then shot the rider with my gun down, Oliver aimed at the third dino and shot, but at the same time the rider jumped a few feet in the air and threw a menacing spear with such strength that it went through Oliver with such speed that the spear landed a few feet behind Oliver with this the attacker produced a blade from his side just before, ZAPP, Daniel stood and shot down the figure that it hardened and fell, unconscious,<br /> Daniel reported to his radio saying that the threat had been counteracted and that we needed a truck and a few more men for backup, he finished and pulled out the three arrows in his chest, with a loud grunt his wounds healed, with that we helped Oliver stand and when he stood I saw his cells working to heal his chest in action a few seconds later his injury healed,<br /> we stood and as the dust cleared we saw another cavity, we tied down the creatures and I and Edward confirmed that the creatures up close were affected by the compound, we tied them up, afterward, we looked at the interior of the cavity, there were no more instances of additional hostiles, and as we looked there were no more additional instances to take care of, the cavity was almost like that of Prime but with differences,<br /> among such were that the cavity was far larger than prime, down the slope we saw were multiple instances of lakes, rivers, forests, and in the distance were multiple huts that looked like a native village in Africa, next we noticed before backup came were instances of B’s, with multiple hues of orange, yellow, red, and as we looked closer instances of blue, and white.<br /> Backup came and they brought the instances on the truckload I told them to install a campsite with personnel, the location would be camped by guards, a few weeks-time I will construct a facility between the two cavities, to better learn of the additional cavity which will be named SCP-ECHO, the instances earlier were confirmed to be instances of SCP 1000 riding what I confirm to be instances of Utahraptor ostrommaysi, which were the only known member of the family Utahraptor ostrommaysi, which is the largest known member of the family Dromaeosauridae in the Mesozoic era, both instances of which are dependent on the compound; the Utahraptors are to be transferred to site-96 and the dependent instances of 1000 would stay in Prime’s facility for a momentary examination, <strong>the foundation was always cold and heartless, but never cruel</strong><br /> <strong>End report</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><strong>containment-logs-5267-6</strong></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Incident report-Dr. Brooks-date (redacted)</strong><br /> <strong>Foreword;</strong><br /> <strong>After all three subjects were chained in separate cells, one by one they woke up and spoke coarse English, so different sets of researchers were assigned for questioning at the same time.</strong><br /> <br /> <strong>Interview log- first set</strong></p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>- hyuman—HUYMAN,HUY-MAYAN KHET, CHIT,SHEAT,.</p> <p>(this state lasted for a few minutes)</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-hYuman Yuman, what you want?!!, talk human talk, TALK!!</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-what do you want?</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>- AY WANT NATING, NATNG, I WANT YUMAN SAFFAR</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-why?</p> <p>(video feed statics)</p> <p><strong>End log</strong></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <blockquote> <p>&gt; <strong>Interview log- second set</strong></p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-HYUMAN!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-what is it</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>- AY WIL SKRAMBOL YOU NUTS YUMAN!!!!!</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-do you have a name?</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-FACK Yuman, I NO TELL NAME ASSOL</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-are there any more of your people</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-No Mor PEPOL in vilayge GO HOM YUMAN</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-where did they go?</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-LELELELELELELELELELELELELELELE</p> <p>(stops)</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-where did they go?</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-LELELELELELELELELELELELE</p> <p>(stops)</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-wher&#8212;-</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-(interrupts), ADOHYO HYO HYO LELELELELLEELELELLELELELELEL</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-oh fuck it</p> <p>(a cloaked entity appears, to which is displayed to be a man of his 50's)</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-(smiles)-(gives the entity the middle finger)</p> <p><strong>Entity</strong>-(touches the subject in a restricted manner)</p> <p>(Warps away)</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-(indistinct chattering)</p> <p><strong>end log</strong></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <blockquote> <p><strong>Interview log-third set</strong><br /> <strong>Subject</strong>- [[<strong>INCOMPREHENSIBLE</strong>]]</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>- speak, your buddies already did</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-What yuman, I no hear, come inside</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-(increases volume) CAN YOU HEAR ME NOW</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-no I have four tiney weensy litt-</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-(increases volume to maximum) CAN YOU HEAR ME NOW</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-AHHHHH, yo bitch I was just joking you bitch</p> <p><strong>O.R</strong>-(maintains volume, but is soft-spoken) WHY DID YOU COMPROMISE YOUR VILLAGE’S SAFETY?</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-(shouts) AHHH YOMAN, PEPOL LONG GONE, GO FUCK YOURSELF AND LOWER YOUR SOUND YOU YUMAN ARROGANT BITCH</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-(lowers volume) is this okay?</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-a little lower</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-(lowers volume) is this okay?</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-a little lower</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-(lowers volume) is this okay?</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>- a little lower, like the most down, I no want to hear arrogant bitch yuman</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>- (indistinct chattering)</p> <p>(a hooded entity appears after subject 2 went with him simultaneously)</p> <p><strong>Subject</strong>-no, no, No NO NOO, not yet merlin<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-700077-8" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >8</a></sup> not yet, they have to pay!</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong>-(indistinct chattering increases)</p> <p><strong>entity</strong>- no, they have done nothing, you would do the same in their place, come let us go</p> <p>(pats the instance by the shoulder reassuringly) (warps away)</p> <p><strong>O.R.</strong> (indistinct chattering)</p> <p><strong>end log</strong></p> <p>//<strong>notes:</strong></p> <p>the instances knew English, how.<br /> they were all taken by the entity, yet all did not fear- the entity may be an ally to the instances, but because they had no time they did what they can to destroy humans, suggesting that no matter what they do they will go to another place.</p> <p>the instances called humanity many names one that I took note of was, the word arrogant, how did they increase their vocabulary for this word when they couldn't say shit properly, or the meaning is what's of the matter</p> <p>this Changes our perception of this SCP, this site can never be an EX class. Not yet at least</p> <p>exploration logs are accepted and recommended upon//<br /> <strong>end log</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><strong>exploration-log-5267-ECHO-1</strong></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>exploration log-SCPXXXX-ECHO-1</strong></p> <p><strong>foreword</strong></p> <p>5 MTF and 2 kilo-tango operatives are to examine remains of, or the instances previously thereof.<br /> Begin log,</p> <p><strong>kilotango-1</strong>- mission control we have entered the cavity and as you can see no hostiles at sight</p> <p><strong>Mission control</strong>- roger that K1 proceed to that village south-southeast</p> <p><strong>kilotango-1</strong>- affirmative mission control (group walks towards the village silently, sometime later while they were walking M1 broke the silence)</p> <p><strong>MTF</strong>-1- (breaks the silence) so Cole how's things man, haven't seen you since the breach</p> <p><strong>kilotango-2</strong>- Ya know, the usual, after I signed as a kilotango I was presumed dead by my mom, dad, family, all that crap</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- lucky you</p> <p><strong>kilotango-2</strong>- what, let me guess, she took your kids off</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- well, ya jus-</p> <p><strong>kilotango-2</strong>- (interrupts) HA!, told you a wife's no good</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- shut up Cole, just shut up, listen she-</p> <p><strong>MTF-3</strong>- (interrupts) ha-ha, jim just got dumped, twice (whole group begins to chuckle)</p> <p><strong>MTF-4</strong>- (imitates a deep voice) in the words of Trump, &quot;just a smack in the ass, you'll get what you want&quot; (the whole group laughs at a moderate level)</p> <p>(thrashing of dry leaves were heard, the group became cautious)</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- mission control were going southeast here to the nearest village, and something just made a sound,</p> <p><strong>Mission control</strong>- heard you M1, stand down don't want any more at you</p> <p>(silence, video footage shows a rat ran out of the bush they stared at and scrambled away, M1 shot the rat upon encountering)</p> <p><strong>kilotango-2</strong>- that's one big-ugly-ass rat there</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- false alarm, just a rat</p> <p><strong>Mission control</strong>- affirmative proceed to the village now</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- affirmative</p> <p>(they walked once again silently, a few moments later)</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- mission control we are over two kliks from the station, and a few meters ahead we will about to fi-</p> <p>(FOOTSTEPS) (THUMPS)</p> <p><strong>MTF-2</strong>- (places finger across his lips)</p> <p><strong>Mission control</strong>- MTF-1 what is it?</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- uhh it looks like a big Iguana- err thing, it's eating leaves sir (video feed shows a light green reptilian quadruped entity, approximately 7 meters long and a meter high consuming fauna)</p> <p><strong>Mission Control</strong>- shoot it then</p> <p><strong>MTF-2</strong>- no sir, can’t do that</p> <p><strong>Mission control</strong>-why?</p> <p><strong>MTF-3</strong>- I spot 3 more around it</p> <p><strong>MTF-2</strong>- 5</p> <p><strong>Kilotango-2</strong>- 7</p> <p><strong>Kilotango-1</strong>- it's a herd, should we engage sir</p> <p><strong>Mission control</strong>- no not yet, stan- ( an Iguana appears and bites through MTF-4's torso)</p> <p><strong>MTF-4</strong>- AHHHHHH!!!!!!</p> <p>(reptillian growls)</p> <p>AHHHHHHHH!!!!!!</p> <p>GOD HEL- (CHOMP)</p> <p><strong>Kilotango-1</strong>- GOD NO!</p> <p>(GUNSHOTS) (ROARS INTENSIFIES)</p> <p><strong>MTF-1</strong>- HOLY FUCK IT’S GOT MIKE, FUCK, FUCK, FUCK</p> <p>(THUMPS INTENSIFIES)</p> <p><strong>Mission control</strong>- take cover we’ll bring reinforcements sta-</p> <p><strong>MTF-2</strong>- FUCK NO DON’T BRING SHIT IT’S A MASSACRE A MASSA- (BONE CRUNCH) AHHHHHH, IT’S GOT MY LEG IT’S GOT MY FUCKI- (CRUNCH)</p> <p>(moment of silence)</p> <p><strong>Mission Contro</strong>l- M-2 do you read me, M-2 DO you read me</p> <p>(moment of static)</p> <p><strong>Kilotango-1</strong>- M-2 is down, KT-2 down, M-3, and I are coming back</p> <p><strong>Mission Control</strong>- M-1 and M-5 where are they?</p> <p><strong>MTF-3</strong>- they're gone sir, probably headed back sir, we should head-</p> <p><strong>Mission control</strong>- no do what you’re supposed to do, how many hostiles were killed?</p> <p>(low growls)</p> <p><strong>Kilotango-1</strong> I’m afraid that how many we killed, was not enough</p> <p><strong>MTF-3</strong>-AHHHHHHHH!!!!</p> <p>(REPTILIAN SCREAMS)<br /> (GRUNTING)</p> <p><strong>Kilotango-1</strong>- HAAAAAAAAHHHHHH!!!!</p> <p>(ROAR INTENSIFIES)</p> <p>(CRUNCH)</p> <p><strong>no further communication</strong><br /> <strong>End log</strong></p> <p><strong>Ending statement</strong>- the team were assaulted by multiple accounts of reptiles in the Iguanidae branch, specifically Green iguanas, as dependent on the compound, no such member returned, another exploration log is in preparation due to the ineffectively of the team</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;/4/5267-2&nbsp;credentials&nbsp;required</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;ACCESS&nbsp;GRANTED &quot;official&nbsp;logs-(redacted)</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><strong>Audio log entry- Interviewer- Madam Schnouze Interviewee- Dr. Edward, date(𶐉𶐉𶐉𶐉𶐿𶐉)</strong><br /> <br /> <strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- Edward, what can you tell me about the walls?</p> <p><strong>Edward</strong>- from what I know this was a facility built by an intelligent race, some time ago, carbon dating suggests it to be over 19,000 years ago, which was to produce compound B315-L that their species may<br /> evolve as one, obviously now it is abandoned</p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- have you read the inscription on the walls</p> <p><strong>Edward</strong>- no, ma’am, we still haven't quite caught hold of the language</p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- I see, thank you for your cooperation</p> <p><strong>Edward</strong>- you’re welcome<br /> End audio log</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>six years later</strong></p> <blockquote> <p>**For (data expunged) **</p> <p><strong>Audio log entry Interviewer- Madam Schnouze Interviewee- Dr. Todd, date(𶐉𶐉𶐉𶐉𶐿𶐉)</strong></p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- Dr. Todd, good afternoon</p> <p><strong>Todd</strong>- good afternoon to you too Schnouze, now we’ve talked with Dravis and we have decided that I would best deliver the message, the journal, and the questions you ask</p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- Dr. Todd, have you deciphered the writings on the walls?</p> <p><strong>Todd</strong>-Yes, it was hard and long but we managed</p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- what did it say?</p> <p><strong>Todd</strong>- a lot actually in this journal (hands journal), it was an ancient memoir, shorn of fable, reviving a man, not an unnatural puff of heaven, Incredible yet credible</p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- to whom?</p> <p><strong>Todd</strong>- in the memory of the children of the night</p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- SCP 1000?</p> <p><strong>Todd</strong>- indeed so</p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- what else would you like to say</p> <p><strong>Todd</strong>- and as I quote on the last part of the inscription, which said as I remember, “The children of the sun had reduced our glimmering cities to ash, the day of the flowers is nigh, and may this vault safeguard our knowledge”, deliver this journal to the 05-council they’ll know what to do</p> <p><strong>Madam Schnouze</strong>- as you wish, (opens the book on a random page), (glares at page), the Tarasque?</p> <p><strong>Todd</strong>- no Madam Schnouze, I believe it's famine.</p> <p><strong>End audio log</strong></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <blockquote> <p><strong>audio log-Madam Schnouze</strong></p> <p>I have read the journal, and the staff at the site specifically Todd and his associates directed a hypothesis that in speculation that the scarlet king had the horsemen(the umber is inconsistent), and the horsemen could never die, as they are spirits that possess another body after their own would perish by pure chance after death, after possession, during this period they will retain the memories of the possessed due to a curse by (redacted) but after a series of mental interaction with surviving horsemen, they will retain their apocalyptical goals no matter how specialized their possessed memories' philosophy can be therefore their goal can never be stopped, only extended, with this they enhance the host's capabilities to an extent that causes havoc,</p> <p>We have contained at least three of the theorized horsemen, namely famine, war, and death, death has been theorized to possess a body of a female child designated as <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-53">SCP 53</a>, famine, as <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-682">SCP 682</a>, with war possessing that of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4715">SCP-4715</a> even if this is mere speculation, we need to act and place wagers, bet that the four horsemen are true and are needed to be immobilized and not to terminate,</p> <p>if we gain, we gain humanity's security, if this speculation is nothing but mere speculation, then we lose nothing, so, therefore, the action is needed</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-700077-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Procedure Rohndrey-76 is the main protocol for SCP-5267.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-700077-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. (See 5267-breach-4)</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-700077-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. main tunnel to SCP-5267-Prime</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-700077-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. incident report-6</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-700077-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. similar to but are not stem cells</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-700077-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. SCP-5267-A-1 has been used in multiple termination logs including one with SCP-████, SCP-5267-A-1 is contained within site 19</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-700077-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. B315-L</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-700077-8"><a href="javascript:;" >8</a>. the wizard Merlin?</div> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5296">SCP-5296</a> | SCP-5297 | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5298">SCP-5298</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chazeasus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6915870&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607830219" alt="CHAZEASUS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6915870)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chazeasus" >CHAZEASUS</a></span></p> 
