				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/junior-researcher-elkoan-s-personnel-file</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#f2f2c2; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;NOTICE FROM THE FOUNDATION RECORDS AND INFORMATION SECURITY ADMINISTRATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below is a file created by Junior Researcher Elkoan, displaying several fictional stories about SCP&#039;s currently in containment. He has been punished accordingly for misappropriating Foundation resources. This file is locked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8212; Maria Jones, Director, RAISA&lt;/p&gt;
